      "originalRows": [
        {
          "blockRef": "p0212#1",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "firstPrintedRow": 1,
          "lastPrintedRow": 6,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "sourcePrintedLines": [
            "远处的物体成像在视网膜",
            "后边的视觉缺陷（图 187а）叫",
            "做**远视**. 远视的人在看远距离",
            "物体时，眼睛就要紧张；而在",
            "看近处物体时明视距离也大于",
            "$25$ 厘米."
          ],
          "box": null
        },
        {
          "blockRef": "p0212#2",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "firstPrintedRow": 7,
          "lastPrintedRow": 14,
          "cont": false,
          "open": true,
          "samerow": false,
          "sourcePrintedLines": [
            "远视要带会聚透镜的眼镜",
            "来矫正. 为了看清远处的物",
            "体，透镜的光焦度要使平行光",
            "线聚焦于眼睛的视网膜上（图",
            "187б）. 位于 $25$ 厘米的距离上",
            "的物体发出的光线（图 187в）",
            "通过这块透镜后发散程度变得",
            "小一些，物体似乎是在 $d>25$"
          ],
          "box": null
        },
        {
          "blockRef": "p0212#3",
          "kind": "fig",
          "label": "图 187",
          "firstPrintedRow": null,
          "lastPrintedRow": null,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "sourcePrintedLines": [],
          "box": [
            804,
            283,
            483,
            863
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockRef": "p0212#4",
          "kind": "cap",
          "label": "图 187",
          "firstPrintedRow": 14,
          "lastPrintedRow": 14,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": true,
          "sourcePrintedLines": [
            "图 187"
          ],
          "box": null
        },
        {
          "blockRef": "p0212#5",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "firstPrintedRow": 15,
          "lastPrintedRow": 16,
          "cont": true,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "sourcePrintedLines": [
            "厘米的距离上；这时，远视的人可以观察到物体而无明显的紧",
            "张. 因此，明视距离就和正常眼睛一样."
          ],
          "box": null
        },
        {
          "blockRef": "p0212#6",
          "kind": "h3",
          "label": null,
          "firstPrintedRow": 17,
          "lastPrintedRow": 17,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "sourcePrintedLines": [
            "80. 放大镜 显微镜"
          ],
          "box": null
        },
        {
          "blockRef": "p0212#7",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "firstPrintedRow": 18,
          "lastPrintedRow": 20,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "sourcePrintedLines": [
            "为了能分辨被观察物体的细小局部，视角应足够的大. 如",
            "果调视范围没有限制，就可以用使物体移近眼睛的方法来增",
            "大视角."
          ],
          "box": null
        },
        {
          "blockRef": "p0212#8",
          "kind": "p",
          "label": null,
          "firstPrintedRow": 21,
          "lastPrintedRow": 24,
          "cont": false,
          "open": false,
          "samerow": false,
          "sourcePrintedLines": [
            "**放大镜** 可以利用光学仪器使眼睛不紧张而增大视角.",
            "从图 185 中可以看出视网膜上比较大的像，对应着比较大的",
            "视角. 在小角度的情况下像的尺寸的比值近似地等于视角的",
            "比值."
          ],
          "box": null
        },
        {
          "blockRef": "p0212#9",
          "kind": "foot",
          "label": null,
          "firstPrintedRow": 25,
          "lastPrintedRow": 25,
